    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: August 2, 2026</em></p>

    <p>The information provided on AIToolvise is for general informational purposes only. All reviews, comparisons, and recommendations reflect my own hands-on testing and honest opinions at the time of publishing. AI and SaaS tools change fast — features, pricing, and plans can shift after a review goes live, sometimes within weeks.</p>

    <h2>No Guarantee of Accuracy</h2>
    <p>I make reasonable efforts to keep content accurate and up to date, but I can't guarantee that every detail on this site — pricing, features, plan names, or anything else — reflects what a tool currently offers. Always verify current details directly on the tool provider's own website before making a purchase decision.</p>

    <h2>Not Professional Advice</h2>
    <p>Nothing on AIToolvise constitutes financial, legal, or professional business advice. Reviews and recommendations reflect my personal experience testing these tools and are not a substitute for your own research or judgment about what's right for your specific situation, budget, or business.</p>

    <h2>No Guarantee of Results</h2>
    <p>A tool that worked well for me, or that I scored highly, isn't guaranteed to produce the same results for you. Results from any AI or SaaS tool depend on your specific use case, skill level, and how you use it — I don't make any promises about outcomes you'll get from a tool I've reviewed.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate Relationships</h2>
    <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links, meaning I may earn a commission if you sign up through them, at no extra cost to you. This is explained fully in my <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>. Affiliate relationships never influence a review's score or recommendation.</p>

    <h2>External Links</h2>
    <p>AIToolvise links to third-party tools, websites, and services. I don't control the content, pricing, or policies of these external sites, and linking to them doesn't imply endorsement of everything on that site beyond what's specifically reviewed. Once you leave AIToolvise, that site's own terms and policies apply.</p>

    <h2>No Affiliation Unless Stated</h2>
    <p>AIToolvise is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or officially connected to the companies or tools I review, unless explicitly stated in that specific article.</p>

    <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>I'm not liable for any loss, damage, or inconvenience resulting from your reliance on information found on this site, including decisions made based on a review, comparison, or recommendation. Use this site's content as one input into your decision, not the only one.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>This disclaimer may be updated from time to time. Changes will be reflected in the "Last updated" date at the top of this page.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this disclaimer? <a href="/contact/">Contact me</a>.</p>

